{"name":"Ebook Website – Inheritance","type":"code/html","content":"\n<html lang="en">\n\n  <meta charset="UTF-8" />\n  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />\n  Inheritance | Ebook Library\n  \n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n      background: #0f172a;\n      color: #e5e7eb;\n    }\n    header {\n      background: #020617;\n      padding: 1.2rem 2rem;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n    header h1 {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 1.4rem;\n      color: #38bdf8;\n    }\n    header nav a {\n      color: #e5e7eb;\n      margin-left: 1rem;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n    }\n    header nav a:hover {\n      color: #38bdf8;\n    }\n    .hero {\n      padding: 4rem 2rem;\n      text-align: center;\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #020617, #0f172a);\n    }\n    .hero h2 {\n      font-size: 2.2rem;\n      margin-bottom: 1rem;\n    }\n    .hero p {\n      max-width: 600px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      font-size: 1.05rem;\n      color: #cbd5f5;\n    }\n    .container {\n      max-width: 1000px;\n      margin: 3rem auto;\n      padding: 0 1.5rem;\n    }\n    .book-card {\n      background: #020617;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;\n      gap: 2rem;\n      padding: 2rem;\n      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\n    }\n    .book-cover {\n      background: #020617;\n      border: 2px solid #38bdf8;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      font-size: 1.1rem;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: #38bdf8;\n      height: 280px;\n      text-align: center;\n      padding: 1rem;\n    }\n    .book-details h3 {\n      margin-top: 0;\n      font-size: 1.8rem;\n      color: #38bdf8;\n    }\n    .book-details p {\n      line-height: 1.6;\n      color: #cbd5f5;\n  